    "Health" : {},
    "Help make putt detection work for every golfer. Your watch records wrist motion and sound while you do a set of putting drills, and one location when you start, to check you were on a putting green. The recordings are shared with the SpotGolf developers to improve putt detection and are not linked to your name or Apple Account." : {},
